<!-- DATA NOTE FOR CLIMATE WATCh DATA -->
<section class = 'sonification-note'>
    <h2>// Data from the Climate Watch</h2>

    <p>Data for this sonification is collated from various sources by <a href='https://www.climatewatchdata.org/' target="_blank">Climate Watch</a>. It contains annual data of greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions for 193 countries, over the period of 1990 to 2022, as well as recent assessments of climate risk and vulnerability. Emissions sources and sinks are published, which supports the calculation of gross and net GHG emissions. Country population data is included allow calculation of all metrics on a per capita basis. For suitable use with musical timing, data has been rolled up to a maximum division of 16 steps/sixteenth notes (using a weighted binning algorithm).</p>

    <p>Each data <i>project</i> in this sonification represent different nation or area. The selected nation (i.e. <i>project</i>) is randomised on load, and can be updated/cycled through by the user.</p>
</section>

